<title>JAPAN: July Nikkei 225 options seen settled at 19,819.88.</title>
<headline>July Nikkei 225 options seen settled at 19,819.88.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>July Nikkei 225 options were calculated to have been settled around 19,819.88 on Friday morning, market sources said.</p>
<p>The official settlement will be announced by the Osaka Securities Exchange after the market closes.</p>
